ite-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a641868161f4a8303d587d4_%E2%80%9C.webp" alt="Black stylized quotation marks on a light gray and white pixelated background." class="quote-icon"><p class="text-size-large testimonial-marquee-desp">Working with this team has significantly improved the reliability of our logistics operations. Their consistent communication and strong execution across international shipments give us confidence that every delivery is handled with care and precision</p></div><div class="bottom-testimonial-detail"><p class="text-size-large testimonial-author-name">Daniel K</p><p class="testimonial-author-desig">Supply Chain Manager</p></div></div><div class="testimonial-marquee-item"><div class="top-testimonial-detail"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a641868161f4a8303d587d4_%E2%80%9C.webp" alt="Black stylized quotation marks on a light gray and white pixelated background." class="quote-icon"><p class="text-size-large testimonial-marquee-desp">They’ve helped us navigate complex global shipping requirements with clarity and efficiency. From planning through delivery, their structured approach and dependable service have reduced delays and improved overall supply chain performance</p></div><div class="bottom-testimonial-detail"><p class="text-size-large testimonial-author-name">Laura M</p><p class="testimonial-author-desig">Operations Director</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section_logistic"><div class="padding-section-large logistic-wrapper"><div class="logistic-video-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a853fae7a2ffe2876d20bab_Frame%202147227243%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" alt="A container ship docked at a port with cranes loading and unloading cargo containers at sunset." class="logistic-img"><h2 data="single-item" class="display-one logistic-title">LOGISTIC</h2></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><p data="single-item" class="text-size-large logistic-desp">Explore our expert insights to gain valuable knowledge and keep your logistics operations ahead of the curve. From cutting-edge technology in logistics to industry trends, we keep you updated on everything happening in the world of global trade</p></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--faq-section--variant="base" class="section section_faq"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large faq-wrapper"><div data="items" class="faq-top"><div data-wf--subtitle-wrap--variant="base" class="subtitle-block"><p class="text-size-small subtitle-text">FAQ</p></div><h2 class="optimize-title">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div data="items" class="faq-bottom"><div id="w-node-_0f9f7724-8fd7-5d28-96f6-82b5fda986bc-fda986b2" class="faq-left"><img alt="Warehouse worker in an orange safety vest scanning and checking items on high shelves." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a6423d810a30074a08ea15d_Frame%201707480066%20(4).webp" loading="lazy" class="faq-img"><div class="faq-buttons"><a href="#contact" primary-button="" data-wf--secondary-button--variant="white" class="secondary-button w-variant-cc3eb973-8864-8224-c466-80ccb68b491b w-inline-block"><div primary-button-text="" class="secondary-btn-text" aria-label="Contact Qelvaron"><span class="gsap_split_line gsap_split_line1" aria-hidden="true" style="text-align: center; position: relative; display: block;">Contact Qelvaron</span></div><div class="secondary-arrow-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _01"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _02"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></div><div class="secondary-hover-bg w-variant-cc3eb973-8864-8224-c466-80ccb68b491b"></div></a></div></div><div class="faq-items-wrapper"><div class="faq-accordion cc-active"><div class="faq-question-wrap is-ques-active"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">What logistics services do you provide?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box is-active-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line is-icon-active"></div><div class="faq-vt-line is-icon-active"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">We offer end-to-end logistics solutions across air, sea, and land freight. Our services include international shipping, domestic transport, freight coordination, and tailored logistics planning to support businesses of all sizes.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">How do I get a quote or start shipping with Qelvaron?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Simply contact our team with your shipment details, including cargo type, destination, and timeline. We’ll provide a customized quote and guide you through every step of the shipping process.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Can Qelvaron handle time-sensitive or high-value cargo?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Yes. We specialize in managing urgent and high-value shipments with secure handling, priority transportation, and reliable logistics solutions to ensure safe and timely delivery.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Do you offer real-time shipment tracking?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Shipment tracking details will be added when the tracking portal or process is confirmed.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Can I track my shipments in real-time?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Shipment tracking details will be added when the tracking portal or process is confirmed.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section_article"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large article-wrapper"><div data="items" class="article-top"><h2 class="heading-style-h1 core-value-title">Perspectives insights shaping modern logistics</h2></div><div class="article-cl-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="article-cl-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="article-cl-item w-dyn-item"><a href="#contact" class="article-item-link w-inline-block"><div class="none">none</div><div class="overflow-hidden article-overflow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af91315821c/6a64310233164a9b6a9081ce_elevate-dI-aXC7DWpQ-unsplash%201%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="article-img"></div><div class="article-detail"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Navigating Complexity in International Freight</h3></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="article-cl-item w-dyn-item"><a href="#contact" class="article-item-link w-inline-block"><div class="none">none</div><div class="overflow-hidden article-overflow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af91315821c/6a6434eddb0d110395aa832f_elevate-dI-aXC7DWpQ-unsplash%201.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="article-img"></div><div class="article-detail"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">How Technology Is Reshaping  Logistics Operatio