ction-large home-services-wrapper"><div data="items" class="home-services-top"><div data-wf--subtitle-wrap--variant="white" class="subtitle-block"><p class="text-size-small subtitle-text w-variant-59a8635e-1be7-4cb6-02f4-94ee59a06f1c">Services</p></div><h2 class="heading-style-h1 display-three home-services-title">Our Services</h2></div><div data="items" class="home-services-bottom"><div class="home-services-cards"><div class="home-service-card"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a64078bea336ecffb4fa5dd_airplane-02.webp" alt="Black airplane icon with orange outline on a white background." class="home-service-icon"><div class="service-card-details"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Air freight &amp; express shipping</h3><p>Fast and secure air freight solutions for time-sensitive shipments, ensuring cargo reaches global destinations with speed and unmatched precision.</p></div><p class="text-size-small service-card-subtitle">Air Freight</p></div><div class="home-service-card"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a64088b75eddfb9cac9372e_truck-delivery.webp" alt="Black delivery truck icon with orange motion lines indicating speed." class="home-service-icon"><div class="service-card-details"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Land &amp; domestic distribution</h3><p>Reliable road transportation solutions ensuring smooth domestic and cross-border deliveries with flexible routing and scheduling.</p></div><p class="text-size-small service-card-subtitle">Land Freight</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_3bd681c4-37b3-783a-5d3b-098abf1f2bfe-13158210" class="discover-service-card"><div class="cta-subtitle-block _01"><img loading="lazy" src="/qelvaron-mark.svg" alt="Qelvaron Global Logistics mark." class="cta-subtitle-icon"><p class="text-size-small uppercase text-black">Our Services</p></div><div class="home-services-content"><div class="service-card-details"><h3 class="heading-style-h5">Discove