a6423d810a30074a08ea15d_Frame%201707480066%20(4).webp" loading="lazy" class="faq-img"><div class="faq-buttons"><a href="#contact" primary-button="" data-wf--secondary-button--variant="white" class="secondary-button w-variant-cc3eb973-8864-8224-c466-80ccb68b491b w-inline-block"><div primary-button-text="" class="secondary-btn-text" aria-label="Contact Qelvaron"><span class="gsap_split_line gsap_split_line1" aria-hidden="true" style="text-align: center; position: relative; display: block;">Contact Qelvaron</span></div><div class="secondary-arrow-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _01"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _02"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></div><div class="secondary-hover-bg w-variant-cc3eb973-8864-8224-c466-80ccb68b491b"></div></a></div></div><div class="faq-items-wrapper"><div class="faq-accordion cc-active"><div class="faq-question-wrap is-ques-active"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">What logistics services do you provide?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box is-active-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line is-icon-active"></div><div class="faq-vt-line is-icon-active"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">We offer end-to-end logistics solutions across air, sea, and land freight. Our services include international shipping, domestic transport, freight coordination, and tailored logistics planning to support businesses of all sizes.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">How do I get a quote or start shipping with Qelvaron?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Simply contact our team with your shipment details, including cargo type, destination, and timeline. We’ll provide a customized quote and guide you through every step of the shipping process.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Can Qelvaron handle time-sensitive or high-value cargo?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Yes. We specialize in managing urgent and high-value shipments with secure handling, priority transportation, and reliable logistics solutions to ensure safe and timely delivery.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Do you offer real-time shipment tracking?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Shipment tracking details will be added when the tracking portal or process is confirmed.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Can I track my shipments in real-time?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Shipment tracking details will be added when the tracking portal or process is confirmed.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section_article"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large article-wrapper"><div data="items" class="article-top"><h2 class="heading-style-h1 core-value-title">Perspectives insights shaping modern logistics</h2></div><div class="article-cl-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="article-cl-list w-dyn-i