r service-one"></div><div class="about-hero-blur"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large services-wrapper"><div data="items" class="services-top"><div class="services-subtitle" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><div data-wf--subtitle-wrap--variant="base" class="subtitle-block"><p class="text-size-small subtitle-text">What We Offer</p></div></div><div class="what-do-detail _02" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><h2 class="heading-style-h1">End-to-End logistics services under one platform</h2><p class="text-size-large">We support businesses throughout their logistics journey. From quick international shipping to dependable domestic transport and optimized warehousing, Qelvaron guarantees efficiency, transparency, and timely delivery.</p></div></div><div data="items" class="services-bottom"><div class="services-items-list" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><a href="/services/#Air-Freight" class="services-tab-link w-inline-block"><div>Air Freight</div></a><a href="/services/#Sea-Freight" class="services-tab-link w-inline-block"><div>Sea Freight</div></a><a href="/services/#Land-Freight" class="services-tab-link w-inline-block"><div>Land Freight</div></a><a href="/services/#Warehousing-Distribution" class="services-tab-link w-inline-block"><div>Warehousing &amp; Distribution</div></a></div><div class="services-items-contents" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><div id="Air-Freight" class="services-tab-details"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a659bf698580dbc248c9a52_Frame%202147227243.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Delta Airlines plane parked at gate 84 connected to