e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a65accae419e49ca4306f54_Frame%202147227251%20(2).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Aerial view of a shipping port with colorful containers, dockside buildings, and water." class="services-tab-banner" width="990" height="660"><div class="services-overlay-contents"><h3 class="heading-style-h2 services-tab-title _04">Warehousing &amp; Inventory Management</h3><div class="services-detail-flex _04"><p class="text-size-large services-tab-desp">Our warehousing solutions help businesses store, manage, and distribute goods efficiently. With secure facilities and smart inventory management, we reduce handling time and operational costs.</p><a href="/contact/" primary-button="" data-wf--secondary-button--variant="base" class="secondary-button w-inline-block"><div primary-button-text="" class="secondary-btn-text" aria-label="Get a Free Consultation"><span class="gsap_split_line gsap_split_line1" aria-hidden="true" style="text-align: center; position: relative; display: block;">Get a Free Consultation</span></div><div class="secondary-arrow-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _01"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _02"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></div><div class="secondary-hover-bg"></div></a></div><div class="services-tab-nums"><div class="services-nums-box"><p class="text-size-small services-num-text">01</p></div><div class="services-nums-box"><p class="text-size-small services-num-text">02</p></div><div class="services-nums-box"><p class="text-size-small services-num-text">03</p></div><div class="services-nums-box active"><p class="text-size-small services-num-text active">04</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section_process"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="process-height"><div class="padding-section-large process-wrapper"><div data="items" class="process-top"><div data-wf--subtitle-wrap--variant="process" class="subtitle-block" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><p class="text-size-small subtitle-text">Our Process</p></div><h2 class="heading-style-h1 process-title" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);">A Simple Process Built for Reliable Logistics</h2></div><div data="single-item" class="process-bottom" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0%, 3.5rem, 0px);"><div class="process-slider-contents"><div class="overflow-hidden process-overflow"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a65b070e3f95147b7d0af0a_Rectangle%2032.webp" alt="Blue truck with raised hood parked in grassy field with hills and trees in background under a cloudy sky." class="process-img"></div><div class="process-slider-details"><div class="process-step-top"><p class="process-step-no">Step 01</p><h3 class="heading-style-h2 process-step-text">Strategic Planning</h3></div><p class="process-step-desp">We assess your shipment requirements, timelines, and destinations to design a logistics plan tailored specifically to your business needs.</p></div></div><div class="process-slider-contents"><div class="overflow-hidden process-overflow"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a65b322151830893c5552bd_Rectangle%2032%20(3).webp" alt="Row of cargo or ferry ships docked on calm water with a forested shoreline under a blue sky." class="process-img" width="444" height="444"></div><div class="process-slider-details"><div class="process-step-top"><p class="process-step-no">Step 02</p><h3 class="heading-style-h2 process-step-text">Execution &amp; Tracking</h3></div><p class="process-step-desp">Our team coordinates transportation across air, sea, or land while providing real-time visibility and consistent communication throughout the journey.</p></div></div><div class="process-slider-contents"><div class="overflow-hidden process-overflow"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a65b3b3ac3bf366797ad9c9_Rectangle%2032%20(5).webp" alt="Large cargo ship loaded with colorful containers docked at port with yellow cranes during sunset." class="process-img"></div><div class="process-slider-details"><div class="process-step-top"><p class="process-step-no">Step 03</p><h3 class="heading-style-h2 process-step-text">Delivery &amp; Ongoing Support</h3></div><p class="process-step-desp">We ensure your cargo arrives safely and on schedule, with continued support to address follow-ups, documentation, and future logistics planning.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large logistics-services-wrapper"><div data="items" class="logistics-services-top"><div data-wf--subtitle-wrap--variant="base" class="subtitle-block" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><p class="text-size-small subtitle-text">Why Choose Our Services</p></div><div class="logistics-services-right" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><h2 class="heading-style-h1 logistics-services-title">Logistics services you can rely on</h2><p class="logistics-services--desp">Built on experience, efficiency, and reliability, our services are designed to support your business at every stage.</p></div></div><div class="logistics-services-bottom"><div class="blank-block logistics-blank"></div><div class="logistics-services-contents"><img class="logistics-services-img" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a65c417743c6238486d18f3_Rectangle%2035%20(1).webp" alt="Large yellow cargo ship named Happy River docked at port with cranes and sailboats behind it." data="single-item" loading="lazy" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><div data="single-item" class="optimize-bottom" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><div class="optimize-faq-accordion cc-active"><div class="faq-question-wrap logistices"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Global Shipping Expertise</h3></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap logistices"><p class="faq-ans logistices">Our team brings extensive experience in handling international logistics across air, sea, and land routes worldwide.</p></div></div><div class="optimize-faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap logistices"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Reliable On-Time Performance</h3></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap logistices"><p class="faq-ans logistices">We prioritize precision and planning to ensure your shipments arrive safely and on schedule, every time.</p></div></div><div class="optimize-faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap logistices"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Transparent Communication</h3></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap logistices"><p class="faq-ans logistices">Stay informed with clear updates, proactive coordination, and full visibility throughout the shipping process.</p></div></div><div class="optimize-faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap logistices"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Flexible Service Options</h3></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap logistices"><p class="faq-ans logistices">From standard freight to specialized logistics, our solutions adapt to your business needs and scale.</p></div></div><div class="optimize-faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap logistices"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Dedicated Support Team</h3></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap logistices"><p class="faq-ans logistices">Our logistics experts work closely with you, providing hands-on support from booking to final delivery.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--faq-section--variant="services" class="section section_faq"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large faq-wrapper w-variant-28061e04-f821-fd5d-fac9-e4ae2574135e"><div data="items" class="faq-top"><div data-wf--subtitle-wrap--variant="base" class="subtitle-block" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><p class="text-size-small subtitle-text">FAQ</p></div><h2 class="optimize-title" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div data="items" class="faq-bottom"><div id="w-node-_0f9f7724-8fd7-5d28-96f6-82b5fda986bc-fda986b2" class="faq-left" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><img alt="Warehouse worker in an orange safety vest scanning and checking items on high shelves." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a6423d810a30074a08ea15d_Frame%201707480066%20(4).webp" loading="lazy" class="faq-img"><div class="faq-buttons"><a href="/contact/" primary-button="" data-wf--secondary-button--variant="white" class="secondary-button w-variant-cc3eb973-8864-8224-c466-80ccb68b491b w-inline-block"><div primary-button-text="" class="secondary-btn-text" aria-label="Get a Free Consultation"><span class="gsap_split_line gsap_split_line1" aria-hidden="true" style="text-align: center; position: relative; display: block;">Get a Free Consultation</span></div><div class="secondary-arrow-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _01"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 12" fill="none" class="button-arrow _02"><path d="M14 5.53023L0 5.53027M9.00002 0.530273L14 5.53023L9.00006 10.5303" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></div><div class="secondary-hover-bg w-variant-cc3eb973-8864-8224-c466-80ccb68b491b"></div></a></div></div><div class="faq-items-wrapper" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><div class="faq-accordion cc-active"><div class="faq-question-wrap is-ques-active"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">What logistics services do you provide?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box is-active-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line is-icon-active"></div><div class="faq-vt-line is-icon-active"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">We offer end-to-end logistics solutions across air, sea, and land freight. Our services include international shipping, domestic transport, freight coordination, and tailored logistics planning to support businesses of all sizes.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">How do I get a quote or start shipping with Qelvaron?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Simply contact our team with your shipment details, including cargo type, destination, and timeline. We’ll provide a customized quote and guide you through every step of the shipping process.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Can Qelvaron handle time-sensitive or high-value cargo?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Yes. We specialize in managing urgent and high-value shipments with secure handling, priority transportation, and reliable logistics solutions to ensure safe and timely delivery.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Do you offer real-time shipment tracking?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Yes. Our tracking system provides real-time shipment updates, allowing you to monitor your cargo's location and status throughout the entire transportation process.</p></div></div><div class="faq-accordion"><div class="faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="heading-style-h5 faq-ques">Can I track my shipments in real-time?</h3><div class="faq-arrow-box"><div class="faq-hz-line"></div><div class="faq-vt-line"></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-wrap"><p class="faq-ans">Absolutely. You can access real-time tracking information to stay informed about your shipment's progress, estimated arrival, and delivery status from dispatch to destination.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section_cta"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large cta-wrapper"><div data="items" class="cta-main-contents"><div class="cta-subtitle-block" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 3.5rem, 0px);"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5e1b2ea7187af913158218/6a627f243f8a67f3a3f939cd_carrot.webp" alt="Orange carrot icon with three leaves on top." class="cta-subtitle-icon"><p class="text-size-small uppercase text-black">Your Delivery Partner</p></div><h2 class="heading-style-h1 display-three main-cta